flowchart TD
    S([CPU 进入算子入口])
    PREP[写入输入、权重、bias 与定点缩放参数]
    REG0[写寄存器: 基地址、步长、K/N/M、数据类型、定点缩放、复用]
    START[写 NPU_REG_CTRL<br/>start 与 irq_enable]
    LATCH[NPU 锁存配置并置 busy]
    LOAD[加载单元发起 DMA 读请求]
    COMPUTE[脉动阵列执行分块乘加]
    PS[部分和保存或回灌]
    FINAL{是否最后归约分块}
    REQ[重定点缩放、打包、输出地址生成]
    WRITE[DMA 写回 DST 并等待 B 响应]
    DONE[NPU 置 done 状态]
    POLL[CPU 轮询 status 或响应中断]
    CLR[CPU 清除 done 状态]
    END([返回上层算子])
    ERR{error 或响应错误}
    FALLBACK[返回错误码或进入软件执行路径]

    S --> PREP --> REG0 --> START --> LATCH --> LOAD --> COMPUTE --> PS --> FINAL
    FINAL -- 否 --> LOAD
    FINAL -- 是 --> REQ --> WRITE --> DONE --> POLL --> ERR
    ERR -- 否 --> CLR --> END
    ERR -- 是 --> FALLBACK --> END

    classDef cpu fill:#E8F1FF,stroke:#2F5DA8,stroke-width:1px,color:#111;
    classDef npu fill:#F2ECFF,stroke:#6C43B6,stroke-width:1px,color:#111;
    classDef dma fill:#FFECEC,stroke:#B64B4B,stroke-width:1px,color:#111;
    classDef decision fill:#FFF4D6,stroke:#B88300,stroke-width:1px,color:#111;
    class S,PREP,REG0,START,POLL,CLR,END,FALLBACK cpu;
    class LATCH,COMPUTE,PS,REQ,DONE npu;
    class LOAD,WRITE dma;
    class FINAL,ERR decision;
